 "text": "Grain Marketing | Gateway FS Your Privacy Choices\nWe and our vendors use technology that collects data about your use of our site so we can improve and personalize our products and services, for analytics and marketing, and to fulfill your requests. We may also share this information with marketing vendors, social media companies, and analytics partners. By using our website, you acknowledge and agree to our Terms of Use. To learn more about our privacy practices review our Privacy Policy . P lease review your choices.\nDo Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\nSkip to Main Content FS Cooperatives\nCareers\nOur Locations\nContact Us\nCredit Application\nFutures\nmyFS Login\nAgriculture Agronomy\nCorn\nSoybeans\nWheat\nForages\nPlant Performance\nCrop Protection\nCrop Nutrients\nGrain Marketing\nFutures\nDTN News\nEnergy\nAgriculture Propane\nFuels & Additives\nLubricants\nLocal Solutions\nCash Bids\nFeed\nConstruction\nFS Agri-Finance\nRiver Report\nFS Agri-Finance\nFunded by Farmers for Farmers\nReview our flexible financing offers.\nCommercial Commercial\nCommercial Propane\nFuels & Additives\nLubricants\nOther Petroleum Products\nFAST STOP Gas Stations\nTurf\nTurf Seeds\nLocal Solutions\nCommercial Generators\nPaint\nLubricants\nProtect Your Assets\nWe deliver ultimate performance and protection, on-road or off-road. \nResidential Residential\nResidential Propane\nPropane Referral Program\nPropane Safety\nTurf\nTurf Seeds\nLocal Solutions\nPaint\nResidential Generators\nPropane\nWe Bring the Heat\nReliable propane supply to power your home.\nGenerators\nNews & Resources News\nmyFS Solution Center\nAbout Us About Us\nBoard of Directors\nCareers\nManagement Staff\nSustainability\nGRAIN\nGRAIN Marketing\nWith us, you gain access to grain markets, risk management, competitive bids, and pricing programs to increase profitability from start to finish.\nIncrease your profitability from start to finish\nFarmer’s partner with Gateway FS for their grain marketing needs with access to end user markets, competitive bids and pricing programs to increase their profitability from start to finish. At Gateway FS, experienced staff provides competitive prices, transportation needs, drying and storage service. FS employees pride themselves on being able to unload grain quickly during the busy harvest season. Gateway FS can meet the demands of the producer and consumer, supplying grain to countries all over the world.\nView Your Grain Account\nCash Bids\nFutures\nRiver Report\nGateway FS Grain Storage and Marketing Facilities\nChalfin Bridge: 618-458-6588\nEvansville: 618-853-2211\nFerrin: 618-226-3275\nKempers Landing: 618-458-6466\nMarion: 618-997-5135\nNashville: 618-327-8218\nOakdale: 618-329-5311\nPercy: 618-497-2135\nPrairie Du Rocher: 618-284-7200\nRed Bud: 618-282-2646\nSte. Genevieve: 573-883-3552\nVenedy: 618-824-6358\nWaterloo: 618-939-6151\nWaltonville: 618-279-7251\nMeet our Grain merchandisers\nAdam Parker\nGrain Division Manager\nRed Bud, IL\nPhone\nmICHAEL bIEThMAN\nGrain Originator Red Bud, IL\nPhone\nphil Saale\nGrain Originator\nRed Bud, IL\nPhone\nFind your Local Gateway FS\nZip Code\nSearch\nMain Office\n221 E. Pine St.\nRed Bud , IL 62278\n(618) 282-4000\nAgriculture\nCommercial\nResidential\nAbout Us\nNews & Resources\nOur Locations\nCareers\nContact Us\nCredit Application\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nBiometric Data Retention and Deletion Policy\n© Copyright 2026 GROWMARK, Inc.",
